DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T013000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T030000
SUMMARY:Kilbourne
LOCATION:Solstice Stage
DESCRIPTION:Emerging from the coastal rainforests of British Columbia’s S
 unshine Coast and Gulf Islands comes Anishinaabe First Nations artist Kilb
 ourne\, the founder and curator of Cimmerian Records.\n\nKilbourne channel
 s a sound resonating on deep foundations. He aims to craft a sonic narrati
 ve deeply rooted in sound system culture. His productions and sets have de
 veloped an immersive sonic identity shaped by low end frequencies and evol
 ving emotional depth. His sound reflects a more refined and intentional ap
 proach to storytelling where each set continues to mature into something b
 oth dynamic and cohesive and unfolds as a carefully curated journey.\n\nLi
 nktree: https://linktr.ee/Kilbourne\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/
 jkilbourne?igsh=MWN4b2czcmc5Z29oMg==\nSoundCloud: https://on.soundcloud.co
 m/WzpOwqkxZLLezUwjsy\nSoundCloud: https://on.soundcloud.com/IP1YtJj30WZs9k
 RUNd\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/kilbourne
END:VEVENT
