DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T213000
SUMMARY:J2
LOCATION:Solstice Stage
DESCRIPTION:J² is Den and BB Stepz\, a Victoria-based DJ duo rooted in BC
 ’s festival and underground music culture. Their sets are bass-forward a
 nd rhythm-driven\, drawing on global club sounds and blending polyrhythmic
  percussion\, moody melodies\, vocal textures\, and low-end weight. They m
 ove through global club\, breaks\, dancehall\, and dubstep with a focus on
  movement\, flow\, and energy.\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcloud.com/jsqua
 redmedia\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/j2__media\n\nProfile: https
 ://thenectarfestival.com/products/bb-stepz
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7740ab13-805b-418e-93a8-4d79d70eb76f@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T230000
SUMMARY:J.F.Killah
LOCATION:Solstice Stage
DESCRIPTION:With a love for the underground and an affinity for deep\, dark
 \, grimy basslines\, J.F.Killah has a passion for engaging dance floors wo
 rldwide. She has graced the decks in Canada\, Europe\, New Zealand\, Unite
 d States\, Central America\, and performed at several festivals including 
 Shambhala\, Bass Coast\, Electric Love\, Rifflandia\, Wicked Woods & Song 
 n Surf. As a member of SHAHdjs and DnB Girls\, her junglist roots play a k
 ey role in her sets but expect a variety of genres depending on the time a
 nd place. On the decks since 2005\, she has acquired an arsenal of beats a
 nd is armed to destroy any dance floor. With classical training on the key
 s and in music theory\, she is able to utilize her understanding of key\, 
 emotion\, and the power of sound to deliver musically dynamic and powerful
  performances. Get ready for murdah because the Killah slays it every time
 !\n\nSoundcloud:\n\nInstagram:\n\nFacebook:\n\nSoundCloud: https://soundcl
 oud.com/jfkillah\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/jfkillah\nFacebook:
  https://www.facebook.com/jfkillah\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.c
 om/products/jf-killah
END:VEVENT
